P18.8 §55/§56 -- PRESERVATION OF PRIOR PHASES, the EVIDENCE side.
date (WSL): 2026-10-02T05:44:46Z

WHAT THIS CAN AND CANNOT ESTABLISH -- stated first, because the obvious check is not
available here. P18.8's baseline (baseline/00_start_state.log) recorded a fingerprint of the
PRODUCTION sources it must not change, but NO manifest of prior phases' evidence files. And
nothing in the whole P18 series has been committed, so git cannot separate P18.8's changes
from P18.1-P18.7's uncommitted work either.

So this log provides:
  (a) a HASH check where a recorded value exists -- conclusive;
  (b) an mtime check for files touched during P18.8's window -- a POSITIVE detector only.
      If it finds something, that is real. Finding nothing is weak evidence of absence and
      is reported as such, not as proof.
  (c) the test-side preservation, which is the three-configuration regression, reported
      separately in regression.md.

